{"game": "redfall", "language": "english", "appid": 1294810, "month": "2026-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1775001600, "end_date": 1777593599, "month_true_total": 10, "quota": 10, "returned": 10, "pulled_at": "2026-09-02 17:06:58 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "223646620", "author": {"steamid": "76561199750681514", "personaname": "Ethernal1010101", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199750681514/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 20, "playtime_forever": 1561, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1549, "last_played": 1776623522, "avatar": "cb72ca835d5c7adaa679bdbce18c352564984264"}, "language": "english", "review": "REDFALL: THE NO-BS REVIEW\nTHE PERFORMANCE: Full in-game 4K 60FPS UHD VSR at  High/ Ultra settings ,frame gen OFF ,upscaling OFF  only TAA (HIGH) is ON with  SHADOW AND SHADING SETTINGS -both being set on HIGH SETTINGS and the REST IS bang ON  ULTRA SETTINGS. No crashes. No optimization issues. My RX 9060 XT (16GB) XFX SWIFT and Ryzen 5700X on AM4 B550M PRO with high-speed M.2 SSD PRO  AND 3600-4000Mhz Patriot crushed it really nicely, like any other AAA modern titles anyway in that matter  so no surprise in this backlog game neither.\nTHE GAMEPLAY: Decent game. Had fun.\nTHE FEEL: Mechanics can be recognized as a bit stiff and rough on the edges in some in-game \"climbing\" sections, but nothing major. It doesn't ruin the experience and it is more about the flow, like the speed of weapon changing or reloading speed aspect.\nTHE TRUTH: It’s a solid game and it’s not a broken mess—it’s a functional, fun shooter that looks great and runs smooth. I personally could only wonder why MS killed the Arkane studio?\nMY VERDICT: DECENT GAME and IT WORKS PERFECT ON MY RIG.", "timestamp_created": 1776622132, "timestamp_updated": 1776623487, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 8, "votes_funny": 5, "weighted_vote_score": "0.499686896800994873", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "223348343", "author": {"steamid": "76561199553670243", "personaname": "Heavens Drunkest Angel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199553670243/", "num_games_owned": 117, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1594, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1594, "last_played": 1713533101, "avatar": "edea68afd57a75255af47916521ba7b4bd0174c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "i don't get why this game ever got hate, its one of my favorite as co-op, cool bosses, awesome intro cinematic, i just never understood, only downside its boring when you play alone", "timestamp_created": 1776308861, "timestamp_updated": 1776308861, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496926248073577881", "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1682985798", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 27, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "223316648", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042072668", "personaname": "Shaky Afro", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198042072668/", "num_games_owned": 213, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 1961, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1255, "last_played": 1776610574, "avatar": "97caee00eb9e2fd9f78eaf034b7f9f4d2fd9210d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bought this game when it was heavily discounted just coz it's \"technically\" set in the Dishonored universe.\r\nCan see where all the negativity came from right from the start.\r\nA bad game in a sense that Arkane lost all aspects that made their franchises special.\r\nInstead made it an online run & gun co-op wi